            "nodes": [
              {
                "id": "PRRT_kwDOUeZuAc6l-2bm",
                "isResolved": false,
                "path": "packages/core/src/project-ui.ts",
                "line": 39,
                "first": {
                  "nodes": [
                    {
                      "author": {
                        "login": "copilot-pull-request-reviewer"
                      },
                      "body": "`projectFeatureUiError` checks that `section.label`, `section.icon`, and `overviewCard.title` are strings, but it currently accepts empty strings (e.g. `{ label: '' }`). Since the helper already enforces non-empty strings for arrays, it seems unintended to allow empty UI labels/titles here too."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "last": {
                  "totalCount": 2,
                  "nodes": [
                    {
                      "body": "Fixed in cdfcbc5a."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "PRRT_kwDOUeZuAc6l-2b7",
                "isResolved": false,
                "path": "packages/core/src/project.ts",
                "line": 114,
                "first": {
                  "nodes": [
                    {
                      "author": {
                        "login": "copilot-pull-request-reviewer"
                      },
                      "body": "`isProjectFeatureManifest` now allows a `category` field via `ProjectFeatureManifest`, but the runtime type guard never validates `category`. That makes the guard unsound: a manifest with `category: 'not-a-real-category'` will still pass and then be treated as a `ProjectFeatureManifest` elsewhere."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "last": {
                  "totalCount": 2,
                  "nodes": [
                    {
                      "body": "Fixed in cdfcbc5a."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "PRRT_kwDOUeZuAc6l-2cR",
                "isResolved": false,
                "path": "packages/core/src/pull.ts",
                "line": 98,
                "first": {
                  "nodes": [
                    {
                      "author": {
                        "login": "copilot-pull-request-reviewer"
                      },
                      "body": "`pullBlockers` builds the reviewer clause as \"<names> has not approved\" even when there are multiple reviewers, which yields ungrammatical output (\"A, B has not approved\"). This string is user-facing on the PR page summary, so it should pluralize correctly."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "last": {
                  "totalCount": 2,
                  "nodes": [
                    {
                      "body": "Fixed in cdfcbc5a."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
